WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Guile Rushes toward crouching Manon.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.750
Standing medium punch hits the crouching opponent.

3
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.400
Crouching heavy punch hits the crouching opponent after the medium.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.250
OD Sonic Boom continues the corner juggle.

5
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:03.750
Guile uses another raw Rush after the projectile.

6
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.300
Standing heavy kick catches the airborne opponent.

7
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:04.750
Heavy Flash Kick connects before the Super cancel.

8
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.450
Low-health Crossfire Somersault follows the Flash Kick.

9
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:09.600
Manon falls after the Critical Art finish.
